pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "#ffffff"
elements:
  - elementId: header-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 0, 960, 50]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$primary"}
  - elementId: header-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [30, 0, 500, 50]
    content:
      color: "#ffffff"
      fontSize: 20
      bold: true
      align: [left, middle]
      text: "4. Selección del modelo cloud"
  - elementId: publica-box
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [50, 80, 270, 220]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [8000]
    fill: {type: solid, color: "#e6f4ea"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 3, color: "$secondary"}
  - elementId: publica-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [155, 100, 50, 50]
    iconName: "fas:cloud"
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$secondary"}
  - elementId: publica-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 160, 250, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      bold: true
      color: "$secondary"
      align: [center, middle]
      text: "Nube Pública ✅"
  - elementId: publica-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 195, 250, 90]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      lineHeight: 1.4
      align: [center, top]
      text: |
        <p>GCP ofrece recursos bajo demanda</p>
        <p>Créditos estudiante: $300/90 días</p>
        <p>Sin inversión en hardware</p>
  - elementId: privada-box
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [345, 80, 270, 220]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [8000]
    fill: {type: solid, color: "#fce8e6"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "#dadce0"}
  - elementId: privada-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [450, 100, 50, 50]
    iconName: "fas:server"
    fill: {type: solid, color: "#9e9e9e"}
  - elementId: privada-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [355, 160, 250, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      bold: true
      color: "#9e9e9e"
      align: [center, middle]
      text: "Nube Privada ❌"
  - elementId: privada-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [355, 195, 250, 90]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      lineHeight: 1.4
      align: [center, top]
      text: |
        <p>Requiere inversión en hardware</p>
        <p>Personal especializado</p>
        <p>Centro de datos propio</p>
  - elementId: hibrida-box
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [640, 80, 270, 220]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [8000]
    fill: {type: solid, color: "#fff3e0"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "#dadce0"}
  - elementId: hibrida-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [745, 100, 50, 50]
    iconName: "fas:cloud-arrow-up"
    fill: {type: solid, color: "#9e9e9e"}
  - elementId: hibrida-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [650, 160, 250, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      bold: true
      color: "#9e9e9e"
      align: [center, middle]
      text: "Nube Híbrida ❌"
  - elementId: hibrida-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [650, 195, 250, 90]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      lineHeight: 1.4
      align: [center, top]
      text: |
        <p>No hay infraestructura local crítica</p>
        <p>Servicios ejecutables 100% en cloud</p>
        <p>Complejidad innecesaria</p>
  - elementId: justificacion-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [50, 330, 860, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      bold: true
      color: "$primary"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: "Justificación de la elección:"
  - elementId: justificacion-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [50, 370, 860, 140]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      lineHeight: 1.6
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p><strong>1. Sin inversión inicial:</strong> No se requiere comprar servidores ni contratar personal de infraestructura.</p>
        <p><strong>2. Créditos GCP:</strong> $300 por 90 días permiten desarrollar y probar sin costos.</p>
        <p><strong>3. Servicios administrados:</strong> Cloud SQL, GKE, Load Balancer reducen la carga operativa.</p>
        <p><strong>4. Escalabilidad automática:</strong> El sistema crece según la demanda sin intervención manual.</p>
